  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nAccording to the documentation, setting:\r\n\r\n> user_directory:\r\n>    enabled:false\r\n\r\nshould disable user directory search by users. However this does not seems to work as advertised.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- Fresh installation with aforementioned configuration used\r\n- Setup several users using synapse-admin\r\n- Connect with a user on element and search other users\r\n- After typing '@', element return a list of every user on the server\r\n\r\nExpected behavior: element should not list the user list.\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\nIssue verified on a private homeserver\r\nSynapse version: 1.31.0\r\nInstall method: Ansible playbook\r\nPlatform: VPS running Archlinux\r\n",
